    "Describe what you need in the chat, and the AI will draw and revise the icon, e.g. \"a blue gradient background with a coffee cup symbol\"." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Describe what you need in the chat, and the AI will draw and revise the icon, e.g. \"a blue gradient background with a coffee cup symbol\"."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在聊天中描述需求,由 AI 绘制与修改图标,例如「蓝色渐变背景,中间加一个咖啡杯符号」。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在聊天中描述需求,由 AI 繪製與修改圖示,例如「藍色漸層背景,中間加一個咖啡杯符號」。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在聊天中描述需求,由 AI 繪製與修改圖示,例如「藍色漸層背景,中間加一個咖啡杯符號」。"
          }
        },
        "zh-TW" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
